 (in water)</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 Tablespoons Light Mayonnaise (not salad dressing)</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 large ribs Celery chopped finely</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 Tablespoons minced sweet or white onion</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">8 Saltine crackers, crushed</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 Large or 2 smaller eggs</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/2 teaspoon salt</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/4 teaspoon garlic powder</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/4&nbsp;teaspoon ground black pepper</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">dash of cayenne pepper</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 teaspoon butter</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3-4 tablespoons clean&nbsp;rendered bacon fat</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-k68hu6fd":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Method</span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-k68hu6gx":{"pinUrl":"https://www.pinterest.com/pin/637329784755478711","isConsentPolicyActive":false,"isMobile":false,"translations":{"componen